{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42016","headline":"吉水县依韵酬华松秀才见寄 · 李中","name":"吉水县依韵酬华松秀才见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官况萧条在水村，吏归无事好论文。\n枕欹独听残春雨，梦去空寻五老云。\n竹径每怜和藓步，禽声偏爱隔花闻。\n诗情冷淡知音少，独喜江臯得见君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}